scale = Vector2(0.18, 0.18)
text = "Day 47. 
The temporal displacem
went wrong. Everyone's 
gone. Erased from this 
timeline like we never existed.
I'm heading to the laboratory. 
If the equations are right, I 
can still fix this.
The facility in Sector 4 has 
everything I need. 
"

