offset_right = 797.5
offset_bottom = 202.0
scale = Vector2(0.18, 0.18)
text = "Day 54. Final entry.
AEON is broken and the 
pieces are missing.
If I could activate the robot in 
a stable timeline with the 
blueprints and manual. It will 
build what I couldn't.
Well in 7 days I couldn’t do it… 
I’m sorry everyone.

Sean C"

